---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; const title='Contact VoxelCurve'; const description='Contact VoxelCurve about bugs, geometry issues, compatibility or feedback.';
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} canonical="https://voxelcurve.com/contact"><section class="hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Contact</h1><p>Found a geometry error, export issue or browser bug? Please open an issue in the <a style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:800" href="https://github.com/chenmu2024/VoxelCurve/issues" rel="noopener">VoxelCurve GitHub repository</a>. Include the shape, dimensions, build style and browser so the problem can be reproduced.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
